  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union for Improving Environmental Monitoring in the Black Sea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be pursued through further technical assistance focused on establishing modern systems and facilities for environmental monitoring (in Georgia and Ukraine), capacity building, assessment of environmental status in line with EU MSFD/WFD and public awareness raising on the Black Sea environmental issues.</narrative>
